        "id": 3874508
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-24T09:36:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately the expectation of `mDeviceLostCallback` with `DeviceLostReason::FailedCreation` have to go before the `adapter.RequestDevice`, because if device creation failed the device lost callback will be called before the RequestDevice callback.\n\nMeanwhile, I have move the following logic into the RequestDevice callback, and also assert the calling count of `mDeviceLostCallback(_, wgpu::DeviceLostReason::FailedCreation, _)` in that callback.",
      "parentUuid": "023eb695_feccb0ff",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1292,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 1296,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "4eeffb214f5d5e5b9887caacf9e25ac5db43e53b",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
