      "writtenOn": "2025-11-24T19:52:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah... this is actually a result of us overriding the default proc for `RequestAdapter` for the test. The expected behavior is actually that the `RequestAdapter` callback is always supposed to happen before the `DeviceLost` one... It might be able to reconcile this but I think it would require doing a substantial amount of changes to how the setup works right now so fine to leave as is.\n\nAlso, though, I think that instead of using both a `ON_CALL` and `EXPECT_CALL` for the device lost expectation, you might be able to instead use: `EXPECT_CALL(...).Times(AtMost(1)).WillOnce(...)`",
      "parentUuid": "d365221b_307f6d37",
